188: \item \textbf{FORC protocol implementation (V67--V69)}: introduction of the First-Order Reversal Curve (FORC) field mode (\code{forc}) with saturation/reversal field parameter control (\code{--forc\_Br}, \code{--forc\_t\_sat}, \code{--forc\_t\_rev}), real-time dual-panel video monitoring of the minor reversal loop, and automated export to \code{forc\_curve.csv}. Added \code{--forc\_sweep} choices to filter branch tracking.
189: \item \textbf{Sinusoidal Demagnetization (V70)}: initial implementation of a pre-treatment sinusoidal alternating field demagnetization (AFD) procedure (\code{--demag on}), sweeping the field from $+B_{\mathrm{ext}}$ to zero, decaying 30\% per cycle, at a configurable frequency \code{--demag\_freq} (later replaced in V72 by an isotropic biaxial rotational protocol);
