38: \title{\textbf{Damping Sweep Simulation \& Analysis Campaign Manual}\\
39: \large\textit{A Technical Guide to Programmatic Sweeps in the Compass-Needle Array Simulator}}
40: \author{\textbf{Antigravity Coding Assistant}}
